Adding all the digits of a number using recursion
Input
235
Output
10

Code:
import java.util.*;
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
      Scanner sc=new Scanner(System.in);
      int n=sc.nextInt();
      System.out.print(sum(n));
    }
    private static int sum(int n){
      if(n==0){
        return 0;
      }
      return n%10+sum(n/10);
    }
}
